# Documentation. Nothing that is built or tested reads these files, so a change
# to them is not a change to the app or to the site. Nx leaves them out of
# every project, CI asks Nx what a push touches, and a push that touches only
# these runs nothing.
#
# The privacy policy and the terms are not here, and are not documentation in
# this sense: they are in apps/web/content/, and the site builds its /privacy
# and /terms out of them. A change to either is a change to the site.
docs/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
SECURITY.md
PWA_TESTING.md
LICENSE

# Read by Dependabot and by nothing that is built or tested. A change to which
# packages it groups is no reason to put the end-to-end suite through the live
# database.
.github/dependabot.yml
